Unmounting WinPE image and creating the USB disk

•	Commit the changes and unmount the image: 
Dism /Unmount-Image /MountDir:C:\WinPE_amd64\mount /Commit
•	Create the USB: MakeWinPEMedia /UFD C:\WinPE_amd64 E:
Finalising WinPE USB disk

Download the preferred Utilities that need to be used (portable versions only)
Download virtualisation software (portable versions only)
Create the following folder on the root of the USB drive: Tools, VMSW and VMs
Uncompress the downloaded utilities in the “Tools” folder.
Uncompress each portable virtualisation software in its own folder
Create “cmd” files in VMSW folder to run the virtualisation software from its folder

Note when creating virtual machine always store them in VMs folder. 

